  <entry>
    <id>tag:github.com,2008:Repository/1401003488/v0.1.2</id>
    <updated>2026-10-05T00:31:57Z</updated>
    <link rel="alternate" type="text/html" href="https://github.com/PylotLight/Blobfish/releases/tag/v0.1.2"/>
    <title>v0.1.2</title>
    <content type="html">&lt;h2&gt;[0.1.2] - 2026-10-05&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Added&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;(preview)&lt;/strong&gt; Range-based text/CSV file previews (&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/PylotLight/Blobfish/commit/e6f479158d8f0a941bed5f90a6de6b47db23dabe&quot;&gt;e6f4791&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;(explorer)&lt;/strong&gt; Tabbed previews, click-to-select, context menu, flat pinned containers (&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/PylotLight/Blobfish/commit/97f44db803660f756584b4f4356fab12ab475cb1&quot;&gt;97f44db&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;(ui)&lt;/strong&gt; Collapsible sidebar, quit button, settings width fix, single-frame logo (&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/PylotLight/Blobfish/commit/a97caf93e216f74413fffcfcdde0e5d093312f3f&quot;&gt;a97caf9&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;(cli)&lt;/strong&gt; Npm/bunx launcher for Blobfish (&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/PylotLight/Blobfish/commit/efd5edd1ecaf0d4b493f61cd02c316ea883dc0c4&quot;&gt;efd5edd&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Documentation&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Refresh status, shortcuts, npm install, roadmap (&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/PylotLight/Blobfish/commit/0b38d5be5017847ba25a8fbe81153b174dd2f939&quot;&gt;0b38d5b&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Homebrew removed --no-quarantine, manual xattr is the only path (&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/PylotLight/Blobfish/commit/d458e982f9f8edc63f07652b995165ee06d54bc2&quot;&gt;d458e98&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Fixed&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;(sas)&lt;/strong&gt; Scope-aware container clients, pin containers, resizable grid, sas autofill (&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/PylotLight/Blobfish/commit/dcd901c2ac314269946b44130f6b81c8c8b5f4ca&quot;&gt;dcd901c&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;(ui)&lt;/strong&gt; Single-root breadcrumb for scoped containers, row-count preview footer, readable context menu (&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/PylotLight/Blobfish/commit/6d57139fc47ef76965d92c4b38e27b1644978a35&quot;&gt;6d57139&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;(errors)&lt;/strong&gt; One 403 for one outage, deduped activity, stale-request guards (&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/PylotLight/Blobfish/commit/90e32571d82e28d1e6866dbab54bc97e7a6c6fc9&quot;&gt;90e3257&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;(cli)&lt;/strong&gt; Keep electron in devDependencies, fetch it on demand in launcher (&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/PylotLight/Blobfish/commit/3119e10893b2c5d58359c0013a2e0abc0337a6fa&quot;&gt;3119e10&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;</content>
